@startuml
!theme toy
title Build, Test, and CI Pipeline

start
:Prerequisites\nCMake 4.3+ / Ninja / MSVC 17.8+ or Clang 18+\nVulkan SDK / Git;
note right
  First configure needs network access
  (vcpkg manifest + CPM source fetches)
end note
:Configure\ncmake --preset msvc-dev;
note right
  clang-cl-dev / clang-dev equivalents exist
  No build or test presets
end note
:Build\ncmake --build out/build/msvc-dev;
:Outputs land in out/build/msvc-dev/;
note right
  game/app.game next to staged
  shaders / textures / meshes
  plus 3 test binaries
end note
fork
  :Run the demo\nout/build/msvc-dev/game/app.game;
fork again
  :Run the suites\nctest --test-dir out/build/msvc-dev;
end fork
group CI - two jobs, same shape {
  :windows-msvc-dev\nmsvc-dev build + ctest;
  :linux-clang-dev\nclang-dev build + ctest\nunder xvfb + mesa;
}
stop

footer msvc-live (Edit and Continue) and msvc-rel (shipping, tests off) build the same way
@enduml
